&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class="smt_anno1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:27pt;padding-right:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-27pt;"&gt;(注)　「提出日現在発行数」欄には、2023年11月１日からこの有価証券報告書提出日までの新株予約権の行使により発行された株式数は含まれておりません。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:15pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:IssuedSharesTotalNumberOfSharesEtcTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:ClassIssuedSharesTotalNumberOfSharesEtc contextRef="FilingDateInstant_OrdinaryShareMember">普通株式</jpcrp_cor:ClassIssuedSharesTotalNumberOfSharesEtc>
  <jpcrp_cor:NameOfFinancialInstrumentsExchangeOnWhichSecuritiesAreListedOrAuthorizedFinancialInstrumentsBusinessAssociationToWhichSecuritiesAreRegistered contextRef="FilingDateInstant_OrdinaryShareMember">東京証券取引所スタンダード市場</jpcrp_cor:NameOfFinancialInstrumentsExchangeOnWhichSecuritiesAreListedOrAuthorizedFinancialInstrumentsBusinessAssociationToWhichSecuritiesAreRegistered>
  <jpcrp_cor:DescriptionIssuedSharesTotalNumberOfSharesEtc contextRef="FilingDateInstant_OrdinaryShareMember">単元株式数は100株であります。</jpcrp_cor:DescriptionIssuedSharesTotalNumberOfSharesEtc>
  <jpcrp_cor:DetailsOfEmployeeShareOptionProgramTextBlock contextRef="FilingDateInstant">
&lt;h4 class="smt_head4" style="padding-left:18pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;text-align:justify;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;① 【ストックオプション制度の内容】&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:36pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;該当事項はありません。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_annoNum2" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:49.5pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-18pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:12pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:DetailsOfEmployeeShareOptionProgramTextBlock>
